RE: Robinhood Markets, Inc. PAC, FEC ID C00780304, Change in Filing Frequency

To Whom It May Concern:
Pursuant to 11 C.F.R. 104.5(c), Robinhood Markets, Inc. PAC is changing filing frequency status from a
Quarterly/Semi-Annual filer to a Monthly Filer. In accordance with this new filing frequency, the next report that Robinhood Markets, Inc. PAC intends to file will be the 2026 February Monthly Report due on February 20, 2026.

Thank you in Advance,
Shiv Verma, Treasurer
